) Clayey Wildlife Habitat Interpretation: Clayey ecological sites have no restrictions in the soil profile. This complex of ecological sites provides habitat for many edge-sensitive, grassland bird species. Clayey habitat features support nesting and foraging grassland birds but may be too dense and tall for sharp-tailed grouse leks. Associated ecological sites include Claypan, Limy Subirrigated, Loamy, Subirrigated, Thin Claypan, and Wet Meadow.

